{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "https://excalidraw.com",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "box_input",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_input",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "1. ユーザー入力 (React UI)\n- 旧版 (A) / 新版 (B) STEP\n- メッシュ精度 (coarse/std/fine)\n- 位置合わせモード (auto/fit/none)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow_1",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 95,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "points": [[0, 0], [60, 0]]
    },
    {
      "id": "box_api",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 110,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_api",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 375,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 210,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "2. FastAPI APIサーバー\n- POST /api/3d/jobs\n- 202 Accepted (job_id 即時返却)\n- 子プロセスを分離起動",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow_2",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 50,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]]
    },
    {
      "id": "box_worker",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 170,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_worker",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 215,
      "width": 530,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "3. 子プロセス (Worker Process: OCP & trimesh)\n- OCPでSTEP読込、mmへ換算、長さ単位 (mm/inch/m) 検出\n- 最大対角長から新旧共通の線形許容差を決定しメッシュ化\n- 変換直後に元のSTEPファイルを即時削除 (容量削減・機密保護)\n- 自動位置合わせ (元座標一致率評価 → 重心＋主軸24候補 → トリム付きICP)\n- 相手面最短距離 (diffDistance) 算出 ＆ VDM1バイナリ出力",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow_3",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 50,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]]
    },
    {
      "id": "box_render",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 160,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
      "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_render",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 115,
      "y": 435,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "4. フロントエンド 3D可視化 (React + Three.js)\n- VDM1バイナリ高速展開 (Float32 positions, Uint32 indices, Float32 distances)\n- カスタムシェーダー (MeshStandardMaterial.onBeforeCompile)\n  * vDiffDistance <= uThreshold: グレー (変更なし)\n  * vDiffDistance > uThreshold: 緑 (新版追加) / 赤 (旧版削除)\n- スライダー操作で uniform をリアルタイム更新 (サーバー再計算なし・60fps)\n- 重ね表示 (一致箇所 discard でZ-fighting防止) / 左右並べ表示 (カメラ操作完全同期)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
    "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff",
    "gridSize": null
  }
}
